title: "E8 Ternary Form Audit: Exact Sparse Realization of the E8 Cartan 3-Form"

authors:
  - given-names: "Salah-Eddin"
    family-names: "Gherbi"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher, United Kingdom"

abstract: >
  Exact computational realization and validation of the normalized E8
  Cartan 3-form in a fixed epsilon-canonical Chevalley basis. The
  repository provides the 16,176-entry sparse tensor, zero-sum root
  incidence representation, exact Lie-algebra reconstruction, exhaustive
  Jacobi validation, bracket recovery, deterministic artifacts, and
  reproducibility records accompanying the manuscript
  "An Exact Sparse Realization of the E8 Cartan 3-Form."

keywords:
  - E8
  - Cartan 3-form
  - exceptional Lie algebra
  - Chevalley basis
  - root system
  - sparse tensor
  - exact computation
  - reproducible research

